<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Welcome - Blood Donation Platform</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #f4f6f8;
      color: #333;
      padding: 30px 15px;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 520px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    }

    .header {
      background: #dc2626;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 35px 25px;
    }

    .blood-icon {
      font-size: 45px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .header h1 {
      font-size: 25px;
    }

    .content {
      padding: 35px 30px;
    }

    .content h2 {
      color: #dc2626;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .content p {
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .success-box {
      background: #fef2f2;
      border-left: 4px solid #dc2626;
      padding: 15px;
      margin: 25px 0;
      border-radius: 5px;
      color: #991b1b;
    }

    .footer {
      padding: 20px 30px;
      background: #f8fafc;
      text-align: center;
      color: #888;
      font-size: 12px;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <div class="container">

    <div class="header">
      <div class="blood-icon">🩸</div>
      <h1>Welcome to Blood Donation Platform</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="content">

      <h2>Hello <%= name %>!</h2>

      <p>
        Your account has been successfully created and your email
        has been verified.
      </p>

      <div class="success-box">
        <strong>✓ Account Verified Successfully</strong>
      </div>

      <p>
        You can now use our platform to find blood donors,
        respond to blood requests, manage your donor profile,
        and help save lives.
      </p>

      <p>
        Every blood donation can make a real difference.
        Thank you for joining our community.
      </p>

    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      © Blood Donation Platform. All rights reserved.
    </div>

  </div>

</body>
</html>